WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.502
An AI video ad maker works from content you already have — a listing page, a product

2
00:00:06.502 --> 00:00:12.694
page or a row of data — and turns it into short narrated ads in the formats each

3
00:00:12.694 --> 00:00:13.932
placement needs.

4
00:00:13.932 --> 00:00:18.414
It works best when the structure of the ad repeats while the facts change.

5
00:00:18.414 --> 00:00:23.708
The source page supplies the photos, the price and the key claims.

6
00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:29.517
A script and scene plan are written from that material, reviewed before anything

7
00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:35.254
renders, and then exported in every ratio the placement requires — vertical for

8
00:00:35.254 --> 00:00:39.683
Reels and Stories, square for feeds, landscape for in-stream.

9
00:00:39.683 --> 00:00:45.410
Variants are made by changing one element at a time: the opening line, the photo

10
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.415
order or the call to action.

11
00:00:47.415 --> 00:00:53.429
That way, when results come in, you know which single change made the difference.

12
00:00:53.429 --> 00:00:58.678
The dividing line is always new footage: if the evidence exists on the page, a

13
00:00:58.678 --> 00:01:00.293
template can arrange it.
